<title>SRI LANKA: TABLE-S.Lanka Hayleys Q1 net up 76 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-S.Lanka Hayleys Q1 net up 76 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30.</p>
<p>(In millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>    Net profit	     80.67  vs	 45.84</p>
<p>    Turnover	    1,722.15  vs    1,628.72</p>
<p>    Tax			45.33  vs	 41.59</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Hayleys is one of three blue chip diversified holdings listed in Colombo. The company consolidates the accounts of 65 units, eight of which are listed.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
